  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jagua plantation Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an investment preparation project for the world&apos;s first commercial plantation of natural blue dyes for cosmetics, fast-moving consumer goods (FMCGs), pharmaceutics, and other industries in Colombia.The fruits will initially be used for temporary tattoo applications.When created according to sustainable agroforestry production principles, the plantation trees will contribute to the reforestation efforts of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
